# ─── Rust build artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
/cargo-lock-audit.json

# ─── Local configuration and secrets ─────────────────────────────────────
# mebookmarker.toml holds OAuth cookies and API keys. mebookmarker.toml.example
# is the tracked template.
/mebookmarker.toml
*.local.toml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Runtime state (contains your actual bookmark data) ───────────────────
/.state/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
/index/*.idx
/cache/

# ─── Generated output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rendered artifacts are reproducible from the database; do not commit them.
/out/
/dist/
/site/

# ─── OS and editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
